WEBVTT

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.870
Because of me...

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:32.710
Yuya!

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.270
Sora?

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:36.180
Hurry... This way!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.080
Huh? W-Wait a minute!

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.650
I came here to see Kurosaki...

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.510
That's why you need to come this way!

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.110
Damn!

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.900
Hey! Calm down!

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.330
Shut up! Don't try to stop me!

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:54.270
Where is Ruri?!

00:00:54.270 --> 00:00:55.870
Let me see Ruri!

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:57.530
Leo Akaba!

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:04.480
Implementing mass into Solid Vision 
has created Action Duels.

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:09.180
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:12.300
the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:51.020
Never-Ending Rebellion

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:53.990
Open this door! Open up!

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:58.810
If you want to see your little sister, 
don't interrupt the Professor right now!

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:02.460
The Professor is trying desperately 
to resurrect Ray!

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:07.520
Leo Akaba is trying to resurrect Ray?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.760
Yeah.

00:03:08.760 --> 00:03:12.000
But Kurosaki ran in, trying to see Ruri.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.740
Who is Ray?

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:16.210
What is her connection to Ruri?

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:17.490
Kurosaki!

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:20.300
Yuya?

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:23.850
Ray is the Professor... Leo Akaba's daughter.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.320
What?

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:28.790
And Ruri is a copy of Ray.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.490
What?!

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:33.850
So are Yuzu, Rin, and Serena.

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:38.980
Ray sacrificed herself to stop Z-ARC.

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.760
But as a result, the world 
was divided into four.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:47.810
One for Standard, Xyz, Synchro, and Fusion.

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:50.900
And similarly, Ray was 
divided into four girls.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.750
Yuzu, Ruri, Rin, and Serena.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.430
And so, to prevent Z-ARC's rebirth,

00:03:56.430 --> 00:04:00.350
Leo fused the four again, 
trying to revive Ray.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:03.960
In other words, Yuzu, Ruri, Rin, and Serena

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:07.330
were originally a single girl named Ray.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:10.400
What are you people talking about?

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:13.050
Ruri's been in my life for as 
long as I can remember.

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:16.510
She was there... Always my little sister.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:20.270
Are you telling me that was all an illusion?

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:23.270
It's not like that! I was the same way!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.980
My memories with Yuzu...

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.580
They were unquestionably real!

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:32.430
But knowing that I was a part of Z-ARC,

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:37.000
I also know that Yuzu was a part of Ray.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.120
And...

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.140
That to save Yuzu, I need to 
use my entertainment duels

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:44.900
to make Layra smile again!

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.320
Kurosaki! Duel me right now!

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:50.670
What?

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:53.200
I'll save this world, in my own way!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.830
Shut up!

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:56.560
First, open this door.

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.910
We'll talk afterward.

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:00.800
He's hopeless.

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:02.250
Why not just open it?

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.720
Fine.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:07.950
Perhaps it's best if you see the 
truth with your own eyes.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:13.110
But promise me...

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:15.400
Do not interrupt the Profe—

00:05:21.720 --> 00:05:22.960
Leo Akaba...

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.190
Is that Ray?

00:05:36.410 --> 00:05:39.870
Is it really Ray?

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:42.390
I can't even tell anymore.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:46.620
Because...

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:52.440
The Z-ARC made from Yuya, 
Ute, Hugo, and Joeri

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.700
was ultimately reborn as Yuya alone.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:01.340
Ute...

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.050
Hugo...

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:04.900
Joeri...

00:06:05.480 --> 00:06:11.630
Perhaps it is because the one from the 
dimension once known as "Standard,"

00:06:11.630 --> 00:06:13.720
now "Pendulum," is the main form.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:20.160
So Ray, who was split among Yuzu, 
Ruri, Rin, and Serena, in the end...

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:23.340
She may have also become a counterpart,

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:26.360
Yuzu Hiiragi, from the Pendulum Dimension.

00:06:29.330 --> 00:06:31.450
You mean... That's Yuzu?

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.270
Don't be ridiculous!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:40.060
Then, what about Ruri? 
What will happen to Ruri?

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:43.100
She may already be gone.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:47.050
Just as Ute and the others no 
longer exist within Yuya Sakaki.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.250
Did you say... gone?

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:54.860
That Ruri is... gone.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.030
Don't do it!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:01.000
Fine. Hit me as much as you like.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.270
That is his right.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:05.460
I...

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:09.730
All I could think of was bringing Ray back.

00:07:09.730 --> 00:07:13.520
Yuzu, Ruri, Rin, Serena...

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:16.790
I thought of their existences as 
nothing more than illusions.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:21.120
But those four did, indeed, exist.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.890
They had their own lives. 
Their own relationships.

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:30.360
I ended all of them, just to bring back Ray.

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:33.830
I am truly sorry for what I've done.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:41.350
Ruri... and Ute... are gone.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:45.440
In the end, duels are all I have left.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:48.810
Yuya Sakaki,

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.020
I accept your duel.

00:07:56.490 --> 00:08:01.070
If Ruri was born from Ray, 
in order to destroy Z-ARC...

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:04.930
Then, Yuya, since you were Z-ARC, 
you share responsibility.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:05.840
Yeah.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.660
This will be the end of it.

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:11.320
If I lose this duel,

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:15.170
I'll accept that Ruri is gone.

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:18.780
Whether or not he accepts it 
won't change the truth.

00:08:18.780 --> 00:08:21.150
I think Kurosaki knows that, too.

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:24.410
But even if you rationally know something,

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.390
it doesn't mean that you accept it.

00:08:27.760 --> 00:08:31.290
Allowing him to do that 
is the duel's purpose.

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:33.510
However, Yuya...

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:37.560
If you lose, you will never 
appear before me again!

00:08:37.560 --> 00:08:39.530
Sure, I accept!

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:42.620
Field Spell Crossover.

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:44.490
Duel!

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:47.340
I'll take the first turn.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:48.360
Bring it on!

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:54.010
I summon Raidraptor — Rudder 
Strixes from my hand!

00:08:57.260 --> 00:09:00.720
When I summon or Special Summon Rudder Strix,

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.190
I deal 300 points of damage to you!

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:09.960
Action Spell Acceleration.

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:12.830
Action Spell No Action!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:15.930
I negate another Action Spell's 
activation and destroy it!

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.370
Both of them are too fast.

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:25.080
They're going all out, 
right from the start...

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:29.050
I set one card and end my turn.

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:31.020
My turn!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:35.280
I set the Pendulum Scale with

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:40.620
Scale 3 Odd-Eyes Light Phoenix 
and Scale 8 Odd-Eyes Unicorn!

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:51.040
Now I can summon monsters 
between Levels 4 and 7!

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.010
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:56.520
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:58.730
Pendulum Summon!

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:01.530
Come out, my monsters!

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.920
First, Xiangsheng Magician!

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:12.260
And the rare dragon with two different-colored 
eyes, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:10:13.850 --> 00:10:16.250
I activate Xiangsheng Magician's effect!

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:18.920
Until the end of my turn, 
this monster's attack points

00:10:18.920 --> 00:10:22.810
become identical to those of another 
monster on my side of the field!

00:10:23.840 --> 00:10:24.920
Battle.

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:28.730
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon 
attacks Rudder Strix!

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:31.340
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:37.420
I activate my trap.

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.920
Raidraptor — Risky Flight.

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:44.160
I negate the destruction, by battle, 
of one Raidraptor, Level 4 or below,

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:46.340
halve battle damage,

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:48.360
and end the Battle Phase!

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:55.370
When Rudder Strix is attacked,

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:59.400
I can Special Summon two 
Raidraptors from my hand!

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:02.280
Go, two more Rudder Strixes!

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:08.260
And each new Rudder Strix's 
effect deals 300 damage to you!

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:12.920
Damn!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:18.620
That time, he didn't even go 
for an Action Card, huh?

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:20.220
And with a double hit...

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:24.430
Xiangsheng Magician's monster effect ends.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.710
Her attack points return to normal.

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.470
I end my turn.

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:32.960
My turn!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:37.800
I overlay the three Level 4 Rudder 
Strixes on my side of the field.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:47.740
Hidden falcon, raise your sharpened 
claws from adversity

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:50.290
and show your wings of rebellion!

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:52.120
Xyz Summon!

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:57.630
Appear, Rank 4 Raidraptor — Rise Falcon!

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:02.830
I activate Rise Falcon's effect!

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:09.930
I use one Overlay Unit to add the 
total attack points of monsters

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:12.300
Special Summoned to your 
field to Rise Falcon's.

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:16.510
And I can attack all 
Special Summoned monsters!

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:22.350
Rise Falcon attacks Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:35.800
It attacks Xiangsheng Magician, too!

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:38.340
Action Spell Miracle!

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:43.040
Xiangsheng Magician isn't destroyed, 
and battle damage is halved!

00:12:44.510 --> 00:12:47.140
Action Spell Encore!

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:51.980
I select, and activate, the Action Spell 
No Action in my graveyard!

00:12:56.890 --> 00:13:00.590
I negate, and destroy, Action Spell Miracle!

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:06.060
Action Spell Encore!

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:09.030
I activate Action Spell Miracle 
in my graveyard!

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:10.300
What?

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:15.110
Xiangsheng Magician isn't destroyed, 
and battle damage is halved!

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:25.140
Another give-and-take with Action Cards?

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:28.250
Yuya seems to have gotten the upper hand.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:31.460
But Yuya's the one who took damage, too.

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:39.630
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:43.730
In that instant, Rise Falcon's 
attack points return to normal.

00:13:43.730 --> 00:13:47.020
Kurosaki has 2750 life points.

00:13:47.020 --> 00:13:48.840
Yuya has 1200.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.940
That's over twice as many.

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:53.410
Now, what will you bring next, Yuya?

00:13:56.880 --> 00:13:58.350
My turn!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.760
I use the Pendulum Scale,

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:05.150
already set with Scale 3 and Scale 8, 
to Pendulum Summon!

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:08.150
Come out, my monsters!

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:12.580
First, Balance Magician!

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:16.240
Then, return from my Extra Deck...

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:18.780
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:21.470
Two Level 4 monsters...

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:24.940
Is he going to Xyz Summon Dark Rebellion?

00:14:24.940 --> 00:14:26.170
Battle!

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:31.680
I attack Raidraptor — Rise Falcon with 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:35.210
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:50.260
Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic 
Battle Up Force!

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.960
When you attack,

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:58.600
I can Xyz Summon a monster two ranks higher 
than a Raidraptor on my side of the field!

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:06.000
Proud falcon, flap your wings that are 
stained with the blood of heroes,

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.490
and travel the path of revolution!

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:11.690
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:16.950
Appear, Rank 6 Raidraptor 
— Revolution Falcon!

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:21.130
Due to Revolution Falcon's effect,

00:15:21.130 --> 00:15:23.570
when it uses a Raidraptor as 
a component to rank up,

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:26.460
it can destroy one Special Summoned monster,

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:29.510
dealing half the attack points as damage.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:32.190
Yuya has 1200 life.

00:15:32.190 --> 00:15:34.250
I've won this duel!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.450
I activate Revolution Falcon's effect!

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.050
I activate Balance Magician's effect!

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.260
When a monster is Special Summoned 
to your side of the field,

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:47.310
I decrease that monster's 
attack points by 1000,

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:51.230
and also decrease the attack points of 
one monster on my field by 1000!

00:15:51.230 --> 00:15:54.400
Exterminate, Revolution Falcon!

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:58.940
I destroy Odd-Eyes and deal half 
of its attack points to you!

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.310
You won't take me down that easily.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.230
When Odd-Eyes is destroyed,

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:13.120
I can tribute two monsters on my side of 
the field, and summon this monster!

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.140
Appear!

00:16:14.140 --> 00:16:18.020
Breaking down walls of crisis, 
strike reliably with all your might!

00:16:19.640 --> 00:16:22.200
Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon!

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:27.800
I won't fall easily, either!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:31.340
I use Revolution Falcon's effect

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:35.840
to reduce Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon's 
attack and defense points to 0!

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:36.970
Not so fast!

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:40.540
I activate Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon's effect!

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:44.550
I send one Odd-Eyes monster 
from my deck to my graveyard,

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:48.250
to negate Revolution Falcon's effect!

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:51.460
Battle!

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:56.660
I attack Raidraptor — Revolution Falcon 
with Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon!

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:07.300
Action Spell Evasion!

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.880
Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon's effect

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:12.910
prevents spell cards from being 
activated during this battle!

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:24.090
Kurosaki's life is down to 750!

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.520
It's a 300-point difference between them!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.000
Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic 
Doom Double Force!

00:17:32.000 --> 00:17:34.670
When an Xyz Monster on my field is destroyed,

00:17:34.670 --> 00:17:41.370
I Special Summon that monster and Xyz Summon 
a Raidraptor of double its rank!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:47.360
Falcon of my soul, use your heart of 
unwavering love and conviction

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:50.780
to descend as my final stronghold!

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:53.350
Rank-Up Xyz Change!

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:55.440
Appear...

00:17:55.440 --> 00:18:00.150
Rank 12 Raidraptor — Final Fortress Falcon!

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:03.980
He has another rank up, after all that?

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:06.700
He's telling us, so clearly that it hurts,

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.670
everything he's staking on this duel.

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:10.870
His feelings for his little sister...

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:13.570
This duel will be decided on the next turn.

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:16.810
I set one card and end my turn.

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:18.780
Now, bring it on, Kurosaki!

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:20.410
Let's go, Yuya!

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:21.910
My turn!

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:26.250
I attack Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon 
with Final Fortress Falcon!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.620
I activate Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon's effect!

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:37.800
I return one Odd-Eyes card on 
my side of the field to my hand,

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:41.800
to negate destruction by battle 
and reduce damage to 0!

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:51.140
I activate Final Fortress Falcon's effect!

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:53.850
I use all its Overlay Units

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:57.920
to banish one Raidraptor 
Xyz Monster in my graveyard,

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:01.390
to enable it to attack one of your monsters.

00:19:01.990 --> 00:19:06.440
Final Fortress Falcon attacks 
Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.560
I activate Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon's effect!

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:14.400
I return one Odd-Eyes card on 
my side of the field to my hand,

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:18.330
to negate destruction by battle 
and reduce damage to 0!

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:22.270
I activate Final Fortress Falcon's effect!

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:25.740
I banish one Revolution 
Falcon in my graveyard

00:19:25.740 --> 00:19:28.710
to attack one of your monsters, once more!

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:31.680
Yuya has no more Odd-Eyes 
monsters on his field!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.860
Ruri... Give me power.

00:19:40.370 --> 00:19:46.430
Battle! Final Fortress Falcon attacks 
Odd-Eyes Lancer Dragon!

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:53.930
I activate my trap! Cross Damage!

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:57.840
You and I both take the damage from this battle!

00:20:13.510 --> 00:20:14.840
It's a tie!

00:20:15.430 --> 00:20:20.440
Yuya and Kurosaki both took 800 
damage from that attack.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.520
For both, the life should be down to 0.

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:31.280
Yuya won!

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:32.410
How?

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:36.650
I activated Odd-Eyes Lancer 
Dragon's monster effect.

00:20:37.480 --> 00:20:40.350
By sending two Odd-Eyes monsters 
from my hand to the graveyard,

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:45.080
I negated its destruction by battle 
and halved battle damage,

00:20:45.080 --> 00:20:48.260
dealing the other half as 
damage to my opponent.

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:52.960
In other words, Yuya only took 400 damage.

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.440
I won, Kurosaki.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:03.670
So now, Ruri...

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.330
I've given up on her.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.110
Is that what you want me to say?

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:08.760
Actually, though, it's just the opposite!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:10.650
Kurosaki...

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:13.420
In that instant, I felt it.

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:20.560
Yuya...

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:22.500
Ute is inside of you.

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.090
He lives on.

00:21:25.090 --> 00:21:26.810
Ute is inside me?

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:28.800
Now, I can have hope.

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:33.280
Whether what's in that core is Ray or Yuzu,

00:21:33.280 --> 00:21:36.510
I think Ruri may be alive inside her.

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:38.850
Yeah, that's true.

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:41.850
Yeah! I'm sure you're right!

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:44.010
Bringing smiles with a duel.

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:48.020
Yuya, I leave the rest to you.

00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:50.220
Sure, leave it to me.

00:21:50.220 --> 00:21:53.850
I'll save Yuzu. And Ruri, too!

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.190
Don't get cocky!

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:05.540
Coward that you are right now, 
you cannot save a single person!

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:51.480
If you truly wish to save Layra,

00:23:51.850 --> 00:23:53.380
you must fight me!

00:23:53.380 --> 00:23:56.050
Fight me with everything you 
have, using all four dragons!

00:23:56.800 --> 00:23:59.870
I... I haven't made Layra smile.

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:04.010
And I haven't saved Yuzu, Ruri, 
or the others yet, either.

00:24:04.010 --> 00:24:08.290
I have to do it... Fight the 
duel that I believe in!

00:24:09.690 --> 00:24:14.020
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Dimension Highway.

00:24:14.020 --> 00:24:16.200
The fun is only getting started!
